    "text": "E1738 CMAJ | November 15, 2021 | Volume 193 | Issue 45 © 2021 AMC Joule Inc. ou ses concédants\r\nCorrection to “Vulvar lichen \r\nsclerosus”\r\nCMAJ has been made aware of an error \r\nthat occurred in the Oct. 12, 2021, issue.1\r\nIn the first paragraph, the sentence \r\n“We treated the patient with high-potency \r\nsteroids (clobetasol ointment twice daily \r\nfor 6 wk, then weekly).” should have read, \r\n“We treated the patient with high-potency \r\nsteroids (clobetasol ointment twice daily \r\nfor 6 wk, then daily).”\r\nThis has been corrected at cmaj.ca.\r\nn Cite as: CMAJ 2021 November 15;193:\r\nE1738. doi: 10.1503/cmaj.211806\r\nReference\r\n1. Cleminson K, Baxter ML. Vulvar lichen sclerosus. \r\nCMAJ 2021;193:E1572.\r\nCorrection\n",
